+/**
+ * Auto-reply has no writer in this build: nothing answers a message for him. A message
+ * that comes in is kept in the notification history and nothing else happens: no reply
+ * through the notification, no SMS, no email draft, whoever sent it. No code reads the
+ * auto-reply switches an earlier build saved, so they cannot change that either.
+ */
+@RunWith(RobolectricTestRunner::class)
